# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify. The Vercel equivalent is in vercel.json and the
# Caddy one in deploy/Caddyfile — all three must say the same thing.
#
# Both Slidev decks are single-page apps: /smolvla-presentation/7 and
# /defense/7 are client routes, not files, so a reload or a shared deep link
# has to be answered with that deck's own index instead of the site's 404.
# Real files under those prefixes (assets, figs, videos) are matched before
# these rules and are unaffected.
/smolvla-presentation/*    /smolvla-presentation/index.html    200
/defense/*                 /defense/index.html                 200
